Silence cut open, full speed ahead.
Gravitational force pulling me into a light-speed passage.

611
00:48:13,112 --> 00:48:16,312
アレグロで今日も舞って
わななく轟音
Dancing today in allegro,
a trembling roar.

612
00:48:16,912 --> 00:48:20,312
The show must go on
消えない一拍を もっと紡いで
The show must go on.
Keep spinning a beat that never fades.

613
00:48:20,612 --> 00:48:24,112
打ち鳴らせ今日も万全で
Play it out today, absolutely perfect!

614
00:48:25,112 --> 00:48:33,112
[Midnight Grand Orchestra 2nd LIVE "ALLEGRO"
2027年2月11日 幕張メッセ 開催決定]
[Midnight Grand Orchestra 2nd Live "ALLEGRO"
Feb 11, 2027 at Makuhari Messe]

615
00:48:37,312 --> 00:48:44,612
しばらく眠っていたあのプロジェクト、
Midnight Grand Orchestraも、活動を改めて本格化していきます！
That project which had been asleep for a while,
Midnight Grand Orchestra, is resuming full activities!

616
00:48:45,412 --> 00:48:47,912
タイトルは、プロジェクト「ALLEGRO」。
The project title is "ALLEGRO."

